# luis - fakes the LUIS ear tag ordering API. RequestToken needs no auth and returns the bare JWT; Export needs it as a Bearer token.

### Request a token (the response body is the JWT; copy it into luisToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/luis/Api/1.0/RequestToken
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "UserId": "{{luisUserId}}",
  "Password": "{{luisPassword}}",
  "CallerId": "{{luisCallerId}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("luisToken", response.body.toString().trim()) %}

### Export - the last 30 days of ear tag orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/luis/Hsa/1.0/Export
Authorization: Bearer {{luisToken}}

### Export - no token (401, empty body)
GET {{baseUrl}}/luis/Hsa/1.0/Export
